<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 105-6 AT CLOSE V SRI LANKA (349).</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 105-6 AT CLOSE V SRI LANKA (349).</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe, replying to Sri</p>
<p>Lanka's first innings 349 all out, were 105 for six at the close</p>
<p>on the second day of the first test on Thursday.</p>
